wh40k-class-specialization-operative-field-aesculapian-name = Apothecary's Hand
wh40k-class-specialization-operative-field-aesculapian-description = Medicine, evacuation, and the use of real supplies.

wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-01-name = Triage Oath
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-01-description = Unlocks the medical stance. Bonuses require a suitable healing item or diagnostic device.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-02-name = Steady Hands
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-02-description = Healing DoAfters resist minor interference, but movement, heavy damage, or losing the target still cancels them.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-03-name = Immediate Diagnosis
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-03-description = Examination or an analyzer reveals damage types, bleeding, and critical condition faster. It provides information, not itemless healing.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-04-name = Hemostasis Protocol
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-04-description = The next suitable treatment prioritizes reducing an ally's bleeding and is actually consumed.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-05-name = Medical Handoff
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-05-description = Transfers a selected medical item from the Operative's hand to a nearby consenting ally. It creates nothing and respects inventory capacity.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-06-name = Work Under Fire
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-06-description = Treating a nearby ally partly preserves tempo after the first hit but grants no protection from the damage itself.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-07-name = Combat Stabilization
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-07-description = Briefly prevents one existing condition on a prone ally from worsening. It neither revives nor replaces a defibrillator.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-08-name = Improvised Stretcher
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-08-description = Makes dragging a critically wounded ally safer and less tiring. Requires the existing dragging mechanic.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-09-name = Triage Mark
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-09-description = Privately marks a visible wounded ally for the group with a brief condition summary; stabilization or lost sight removes it.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-10-name = Second Chance
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-10-description = After a real defibrillator succeeds, the ally briefly resists immediately returning to critical condition. The device, charge, and all use conditions remain mandatory.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-11-name = Precise Doses
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-11-description = A suitable treatment is consumed normally but works better against one defined damage type; it does not heal every category.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-12-name = Analgesic Protocol
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-12-description = Applies a real held analgesic to one visible ally, briefly reducing a medical penalty. This treats a condition, not the whole squad's combat stats.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-13-name = Medical Node
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-13-description = Deploys a portable crate containing real inserted medicine. It generates nothing and may be dismantled or stolen.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-14-name = Paired Procedure
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-14-description = When another ally treats the same patient with a different suitable item, both actions gain a small speed bonus without doubling healing.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-15-name = Evacuation Line
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-15-description = Pulls a visible prone ally a limited safe distance along a clear path. It cannot cross walls, airlocks, containers, or restricted zones.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-16-name = Clean Dressing
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-16-description = After stopping bleeding, the Operative's next treatment repairs tissue better, but only for that patient and within a brief window.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-17-name = Supply Exchange
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-17-description = Enables a protected group action to pass a selected medical item quickly; the server checks range, capacity, and consent.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-18-name = Field Triage
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-18-description = Briefly marks an evacuation zone around the Operative, showing nearby allies' state in the triage panel and accelerating treatment start. The zone does not heal or buff by itself.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-19-name = Final Dressing
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-19-description = Once per long interval, the first minor damage does not interrupt treatment of a critical ally. It never triggers on the Operative.
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-20-name = Warden of Life
wh40k-class-skill-operative-field-aesculapian-20-description = Final node: combines triage, stabilization, and real medical supplies in one capped modifier that works only during actual medical treatment and does not stack between Aesculapians.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeHemostaticProtocol = hemostatic protocol
    .desc = Prepare the next real medical-item use on the selected injured ally.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeMedicalTransfer = medical transfer
    .desc = Offer the held medical item to an ally; the recipient must confirm.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeCombatStabilization = combat stabilization
    .desc = Prepare a bounded real-item treatment for a downed ally.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeTriageMark = triage mark
    .desc = Privately mark a visible injured ally for follow-up.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeAnalgesicProtocol = analgesic protocol
    .desc = Prepare the next suitable consumable treatment on an injured ally.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeMedicalNode = medical node
    .desc = Put down a real held medical kit without creating supplies.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeEvacuationLine = evacuation line
    .desc = Pull a visible downed ally a short distance along a clear path.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeSupplyExchange = supply exchange
    .desc = Offer a held medical item through a server-checked consent action.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeFieldTriage = field triage
    .desc = Privately count visible injured allies nearby; this does not heal them.
ent-ActionWh40kOperativeAcceptTransfer = accept medical transfer
    .desc = Accept the pending medical item if range and hand capacity still permit it.

wh40k-class-triage-scan-result = Triage scan: { $count } injured allies in the clear area.
